ga5U(){return"Tap a card to open the damage dialog. Damage changes in 10/50/100 steps, matching the real 10/50/100-point damage counters, and you can reset only that card's damage from the dialog. Drag a card to swap it between the bench and the active spot (its marker follows the same Pok\xe9mon). The Ability label at the bottom of each card is a manual reminder for whether that Pok\xe9mon's ability has been used. Tap it to switch between unused and used. It isn't reset automatically, so toggle it whenever it fits your situation."},
