ga5W(){return"Refresh icon: after confirmation, resets that player's progress \u2014 damage, Special Conditions, Ability usage, Lost Zone, turn actions, and the GX/VSTAR marker's used flag (display and theme settings are not reset).\nCoin Toss: flips a coin.\nMenu (\u22ee): Battle Display changes bench slots and markers. Bench slots apply only to the current battle, while marker selections carry over to the next one. End Battle returns to Home after confirmation."},
ga60(){return"Special conditions"},
ga6_(){return"Track Poison, Burn, Sleep, Paralysis, and Confusion. Sleep, Paralysis, and Confusion can only be active one at a time \u2014 choosing a new one clears the previous automatically. Poison and Burn can be combined with any of them."},
